  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Wouldn't it be better organized if Cloning was made into an option with three states:\n- Off\n- Temporary\n- On\nIf Cloning is set to \"Temporary\" it will change back to \"Off\" when you load into a new world. Just as this feature request is supposed to do.\nThe advantage to this is that people won't get confused about some second obscure setting that keeps changing their Cloning setting.\nI can however see this being an issue if you want to preserve the option on the old Settings menu still. Since that likely won't support a checkbox with three states without being confusing to people. I guess at worst this third state would just not be available on the old Settings menu anyway.",
